			{
				"id": "m3",
				"role": "assistant",
				"content": "One file, one conversation: .curt is a single JSON file that holds a whole chat — envelope, conversation, messages — so any app can read it without a database.\n\nAnd no: readers parse the file wherever it lives. This viewer runs entirely in your browser.",
